This made a whole slew of sound modules fail (snd_pcm, etc).

Now, some of this I could just compile in to the kernel.  Some of the
conntrack stuff, I believe, cannot be compiled in (it must be a module)
if memory serves.

Thoughts?

Thanks yet again,
John



