Hello,

I recently installed kernel 2.6.1 on my LX164 machine that has a single
Symbios SYM53c875 card driving two UW SCSI 9GB drives.

Kernel 2.4.23 works fine on my machine.

Kernel 2.6.1 boots OK and runs OK for a few minutes.  After that,
however, I start getting messages like this:

Jan 15 16:44:01 erwin kernel: lost page write due to I/O error on dm-1
Jan 15 16:44:01 erwin kernel: SCSI error : <0 0 6 0> return code = 0x70000
Jan 15 16:44:01 erwin kernel: end_request: I/O error, dev sdb, sector 4773424
