735
an 15 16:43:29 erwin kernel: lost page write due to I/O error on dm-1
Jan 15 16:43:29 erwin kernel: SCSI error : <0 0 0 0> return code = 0x70000
Jan 15 16:43:29 erwin kernel: end_request: I/O error, dev sda, sector 4778272
Jan 15 16:43:29 erwin kernel: Buffer I/O error on device dm-1, logical block 188
944
Jan 15 16:43:29 erwin kernel: lost page write due to I/O error on dm-1

Some things to observe:
 * This appears on both physical disks
 * It occurs at varying sectors, but strangely they all see mto start
   with 469 or 470

The system is an AlphaPC 164LX, 21164a CPU, SRM console.  Running
stock unpatched 2.6.1.   Here is my config file:

